inment industry."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1161, "end": 1303, "text": "Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer, born in 1953, was a talented actress who appeared in numerous German films and television shows throughout her career."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1304, "end": 1447, "text": "Herbert Grönemeyer, born in 1956, is a multi-platinum selling singer, musician, and actor who has been a household name in Germany for decades."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1448, "end": 1541, "text": "\"Herbert and Anna are an inspiration to us all,\" said German actress and friend, Iris Berben."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1542, "end": 1666, "text": "\"They've built a life together that's filled with love, laughter, and a deep respect for each other's talents and passions.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1667, "end": 1823, "text": "Data from the German Federal Statistical Office shows that the couple's marriage has endured for over three decades, a rarity in the entertainment industry."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1824, "end": 2001, "text": "According to a 2020 survey by the German magazine, _Bunte_, Herbert Grönemeyer and Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer were ranked among the top 10 most beloved celebrity couples in Germany."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2002, "end": 2153, "text": "While the couple's personal life has been subject to media scrutiny over the years, they have consistently demonstrated their commitment to each other."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2154, "end": 2311, "text": "In a 2015 interview with _Die Zeit_, Herbert Grönemeyer spoke about the importance of his marriage, saying, \"Anna is my rock, my partner, and my best friend."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 39, "text": "**BERLIN, GERMANY - FEBRUARY 10, 1995**"}